# Mobile App Environment Variables Template
# The IT infrastructure plan requires three isolated environments:
# Development, Staging, and Production.

# Local Development (Expo Go on physical device)
# Use your computer's LAN IP: ipconfig (Windows) or ifconfig (Mac/Linux)
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://YOUR_LAN_IP:4000/api/v1

# Local web/emulator testing on same machine:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1

# --- IT Environment Configurations ---
# These should be injected securely during EAS builds via EAS Secrets

# Development Build Profile (EAS channel: development)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://dev.api.globalopportunitydesk.com/api/v1

# Staging Build Profile (EAS channel: staging)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://staging.api.globalopportunitydesk.com/api/v1

# Production Build Profile (EAS channel: production)
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.globalopportunitydesk.com/api/v1
